h1 W3C Web Accessibility Initiative Home
row
  col
    h2 Making the Web Accessible
    text Strategies, standards, and supporting resources to help you make the Web more accessible to people with disabilities.
  row
    col
      h3 W3C
      text The World Wide Web Consortium (W3C) develops international standards for the Web: HTML, CSS, and many more.
    col
      h3 WAI
      text The W3C Web Accessibility Initiative (WAI) develops standards and support materials to help you understand and implement accessibility.
    col
      h3 You
      text You can use W3C WAI resources to make your websites, applications, and other digital creations more accessible and usable to everyone.
  button "Hide Section"
